#                       fires at the @io/silicon (LAPACK FFI) boundary
#                       the discharge terminates at),
#                      [[architecture-mirror-as-expanding-hilbert-
#                       space]] (#51; each math↔silicon translation
#                       extends H by one morphism crystal at species
#                       altitude),
