#                       binding is the next-tick empirical discharge).
# Related shards: glue.mirror (the family-root; this species inherits
#                  the morphism-category discipline + the
#                  glue_witnessing bilateral),
#                 reality/algebra/math.mirror (the source_prism this
#                  species' correspondences originate at; the
#                  math_crystal + reflexive_a_side + math_species_
#                  witnessing family the discharge consumes),
#                 reality/algebra/silicon.mirror (the target_prism
#                  this species' correspondences terminate at; the
#                  silicon_crystal + hardware_realized + silicon_
#                  species_witnessing family the discharge lands in),
#                 epistemologic/math/cholesky.mirror (the theorem
