# Path-namespace property: this file at
# `shards/glue/math_silicon.mirror` declares
# `@glue/math_silicon` per the
# `@epistemologic/pact/path_matches_namespace` rule.

source @arxiv/math/cholesky-1910
source @arxiv/math/anderson-lapack-1992
source @arxiv/math/lawson-hanson-kincaid-krogh-1979
source @arxiv/math/mesland-2013
source @arxiv/math/kasparov-1981
source @arxiv/math/chamseddine-connes-1996
source @arxiv/math/wilkinson-1961
